# Application / local-development overrides.
#
# Copy to `.env` and fill in. `.env` is gitignored (`.gitignore`); this template
# is committed (negated by `!.env.example`) so it can never carry a real value.
#
# This file is deliberately almost empty. Every key below was located by
# grepping `import.meta.env.<NAME>` across `src/` and `packages/`; a key that no
# source file reads is not a setting, it is a comment that lies to the next
# reader. Vite's built-ins (DEV / PROD / MODE / SSR) are supplied by Vite.
#
# Database credentials for the driver contract **live tier** do NOT belong here.
# They live in `.env.test` — see `.env.test.example`.

# Enables `data-testid` hooks for WebdriverIO.
# Read by packages/ui/src/tid.ts, src/commands/connection.ts, src/commands/transfer.ts.
# 1 = on, unset = off. Leave unset for normal development; the E2E harness sets
# it as part of `pnpm tauri:build:webdriver`.
VITE_E2E=